#: ../../funding/songjiang-data-2026.rst:1
msgid "Songjiang Data Elements Special Fund, second 2026 batch"
msgstr "2026松江区数据要素专项资金第二批"

#: ../../funding/songjiang-data-2026.rst:4
msgid "Grant / reimbursement | Songjiang"
msgstr "补助与报销｜松江区"

#: ../../funding/songjiang-data-2026.rst:6
msgid "2026 call published; deadline check required"
msgstr "2026通知已公布，须核验截止日"

#: ../../funding/songjiang-data-2026.rst:8
msgid ""
"`Evidence S124 "
"<https://www.songjiang.gov.cn/ztzl/005019/005019002/20260803/9bd36209-64ca-48b3-8e17-5c929ce97f1b.html>`_. "
"关于开展2026年度第二批松江区数据要素专项资金项目申报的通知."
msgstr "`证据 S124 <https://www.songjiang.gov.cn/ztzl/005019/005019002/20260803/9bd36209-64ca-48b3-8e17-5c929ce97f1b.html>`_. 关于开展2026年度第二批松江区数据要素专项资金项目申报的通知."

#: ../../funding/songjiang-data-2026.rst:10
msgid "Amount and mechanism"
msgstr "额度与机制"

#: ../../funding/songjiang-data-2026.rst:13
msgid ""
"Project-specific support under the district data-elements special fund "
"rules"
msgstr "依松江区数据要素专项资金管理办法按核定项目给予资助"

#: ../../funding/songjiang-data-2026.rst:15
msgid "No equity"
msgstr "不占股"

#: ../../funding/songjiang-data-2026.rst:17
msgid "Eligibility and timing"
msgstr "资格与时间"

#: ../../funding/songjiang-data-2026.rst:20
msgid ""
"Lawfully operating Songjiang organizations developing high-quality "
"datasets, corpus governance, data-product listings or AI data-space "
"applications."
msgstr "在松江依法经营、开展高质量数据集建设、语料治理、数据产品挂牌或人工智能数据空间应用的单位。"

#: ../../funding/songjiang-data-2026.rst:22
msgid ""
"Second 2026 batch notice issued August 2026; confirm current acceptance "
"status"
msgstr "2026年第二批通知于8月发布，须核验当前受理状态"

#: ../../funding/songjiang-data-2026.rst:24
msgid "Contact and application"
msgstr "联系与申请"

#: ../../funding/songjiang-data-2026.rst:27
msgid ""
"`Official application / policy route <https://www.songjiang.gov.cn/>`_"
msgstr "`官方申请／政策入口 <https://www.songjiang.gov.cn/>`_"

#: ../../funding/songjiang-data-2026.rst:29
msgid ""
"The linked authority or operator is the contact route. A direct current "
"program contact is not established in this profile."
msgstr "请通过所链主管部门或运营方联系，本档案未核实现任项目直接联系人。"

#: ../../funding/songjiang-data-2026.rst:31
msgid ""
"Editorial application checklist. The current official notice or agreement "
"controls the actual procedure."
msgstr "编辑申请清单，实际流程以现行官方通知或协议为准。"

#: ../../funding/songjiang-data-2026.rst:33
msgid ""
"Read the dated call and verify district, entity, activity and "
"spending-period rules."
msgstr "阅读带日期通知，核验属地、主体、业务及支出期间。"

#: ../../funding/songjiang-data-2026.rst:35
msgid ""
"Prepare the prescribed pack and complete host or district endorsement if "
"required."
msgstr "准备规定材料，按要求完成单位或区级推荐。"

#: ../../funding/songjiang-data-2026.rst:37
msgid ""
"Submit through the official platform before the stated deadline and keep "
"the receipt."
msgstr "在截止前通过官方平台提交并保存回执。"

#: ../../funding/songjiang-data-2026.rst:39
msgid ""
"Follow review, award, reporting, acceptance and payment obligations in "
"the notice."
msgstr "遵循通知中的评审、立项、报告、验收及拨付义务。"

#: ../../funding/songjiang-data-2026.rst:41
msgid ""
"The published maximum is a ceiling, not an entitlement. Check the "
"applicable notice, eligible cost period, other public support and written "
"payment conditions."
msgstr "公布最高额为上限，不构成当然权益。须核验适用通知、合资格支出期间、其他财政资助及书面拨付条件。"
